- `src/course-outline/`: course outline, section/subsection/unit cards, publish/delete/reorder/configure flows.
- `src/course-outline/data/api.js`: Studio contentstore and XBlock calls for outline mutation.
- `src/course-unit/`: unit/vertical authoring experience and embedded XBlock container.
